{"title":"welcome to life, my dear","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/welcome-to-life-my-dear","date":1787587842000,"content":"<figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fcac0824-989a-46ea-8317-15a333ba1c86/IMG_0648.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fcac0824-989a-46ea-8317-15a333ba1c86/IMG_0648.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fcac0824-989a-46ea-8317-15a333ba1c86/IMG_0648.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fcac0824-989a-46ea-8317-15a333ba1c86/IMG_0648.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fcac0824-989a-46ea-8317-15a333ba1c86/IMG_0648.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fcac0824-989a-46ea-8317-15a333ba1c86/IMG_0648.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fcac0824-989a-46ea-8317-15a333ba1c86/IMG_0648.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/fcac0824-989a-46ea-8317-15a333ba1c86/IMG_0648.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>from </strong><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/journal/tag/marseille\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>marseille</strong></a><strong> | visit my </strong><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/journal/tag/sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>sketchbook</strong></a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n\n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n \n\n\n  <p>I painted this on my last day in marseille, as a gift for my friend Zeynep’s 18 month old baby, Talya. I started at 11PM that night, and finished around 2AM. it captures a slow moment that I wrote about in a recent <a href=\"https://buttondown.com/keningzhu/archive/welcome-to-life-my-dear/\" target=\"_blank\">newsletter</a> —<br /></p><blockquote><p><em>once, on a windy afternoon, I laid down with her on a picnic blanket in the garden. I talked to her about the sky, the birds, the plants, the wind, the cicadas, the cats, the house, her mother, her father, marseille, france, istanbul, turkey.</em></p><p><em>then I asked her questions like — where did you come from? what’s that place like? do you know where we’re going, after this? she turned her face to me, very close, and just smiled. we laughed about it. oh well, I said. hayata hoş geldin, canım.</em></p><p><em>welcome to life, my dear.</em></p></blockquote>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d45546d0-2f42-4d3d-8e11-5b2a07ac01f7/IMG_0654.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d45546d0-2f42-4d3d-8e11-5b2a07ac01f7/IMG_0654.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d45546d0-2f42-4d3d-8e11-5b2a07ac01f7/IMG_0654.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d45546d0-2f42-4d3d-8e11-5b2a07ac01f7/IMG_0654.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d45546d0-2f42-4d3d-8e11-5b2a07ac01f7/IMG_0654.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d45546d0-2f42-4d3d-8e11-5b2a07ac01f7/IMG_0654.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d45546d0-2f42-4d3d-8e11-5b2a07ac01f7/IMG_0654.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d45546d0-2f42-4d3d-8e11-5b2a07ac01f7/IMG_0654.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/88f70f94-d67e-4e14-a7c9-77137a41348f/IMG_0638.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/88f70f94-d67e-4e14-a7c9-77137a41348f/IMG_0638.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/88f70f94-d67e-4e14-a7c9-77137a41348f/IMG_0638.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/88f70f94-d67e-4e14-a7c9-77137a41348f/IMG_0638.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/88f70f94-d67e-4e14-a7c9-77137a41348f/IMG_0638.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/88f70f94-d67e-4e14-a7c9-77137a41348f/IMG_0638.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/88f70f94-d67e-4e14-a7c9-77137a41348f/IMG_0638.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/88f70f94-d67e-4e14-a7c9-77137a41348f/IMG_0638.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/13e367ca-f0c0-42e8-b133-ac32e246dc19/IMG_0639.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/13e367ca-f0c0-42e8-b133-ac32e246dc19/IMG_0639.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/13e367ca-f0c0-42e8-b133-ac32e246dc19/IMG_0639.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/13e367ca-f0c0-42e8-b133-ac32e246dc19/IMG_0639.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/13e367ca-f0c0-42e8-b133-ac32e246dc19/IMG_0639.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/13e367ca-f0c0-42e8-b133-ac32e246dc19/IMG_0639.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/13e367ca-f0c0-42e8-b133-ac32e246dc19/IMG_0639.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/13e367ca-f0c0-42e8-b133-ac32e246dc19/IMG_0639.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n \n\n\n  <p>it’s an interesting feeling to have relationships with my friends’ children - and knowing that I will observe them growing older, year by year. I intend to paint one page with every visit - so that by the time Talya is 18, she will have a full storybook. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n \n  \n\n\n\n  <hr />\n  \n    \n\n    \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>from </strong><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/journal/tag/marseille\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>marseille</strong></a><strong> | visit my </strong><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/journal/tag/sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>sketchbook</strong></a><strong> | more </strong><a href=\"https://keningonline.squarespace.com/visual-art\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>visual art</strong></a></p>","author":"Kening Zhu","siteTitle":"kening zhu","siteHash":"ef8a94b9fc20c32a4ee7d94ee971337d278e8b2fafe747123e4eb5cea026e84e","entryHash":"c3c32e138c58dc6145c1f8cd2a932b48c1de7bb4e9d0266d6eb0befd8c231cfc","category":"Sites"}